          <p>You do not need to arrive with the answer. Clarifying what matters now, exploring realistic possibilities, and creating criteria for a decision are central parts of the work.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="chapter-faq">
          <summary>Why does the program last 16 weeks?</summary>
          <p>The first eight weekly sessions create continuity and momentum. The later two-week gaps give you room to test decisions and new responses in real life, then return to reflect and adjust.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="chapter-faq">
          <summary>Can I do this alongside a demanding job?</summary>
          <p>Yes, if you have some capacity for reflection and small practical steps. The work is tailored to your actual energy, responsibilities, and pace rather than built around a fixed amount of homework.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="chapter-faq">
          <summary>Is this career advice or job-search support?</summary>
          <p>No. This is coaching for the decisions, patterns, and inner change behind a life or career transition. It does not include recruitment, CV writing, or job placement.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="chapter-faq">
          <summary>What happens during the discovery call?</summary>
          <p>We use 30 minutes to understand what you want support with, consider whether coaching fits, and see how it feels to speak together. You do not need to decide or commit during the call.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="chapter-faq">
          <summary>Is the discovery call free?</summary>
